# Advisories the Worker's runtime audit accepts for a short, recorded time
# (.github/workflows/ci.yml, job edge: npm audit --omit=dev, every severity,
# through ../deploy/ci/audit_gate.py npm).
#
# Empty unless an advisory blocks every deploy and cannot be fixed forward
# soon (often: no fixed version exists yet): docs/operations.md, "A dependency
# audit blocks a deploy". Each entry is one GHSA ID (the one in the
# advisory's github.com/advisories URL, which npm audit reports) with an
# expiry date, preceded by a comment with the date, who reviewed it, and why
# the vulnerable code is not reachable in the Worker:
#
#   # 2026-11-02 owner: libfoo in the Worker; the affected path never runs; no fix yet
#   GHSA-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx exp:2026-12-02
#
# The gate stops accepting an entry on its expiry date, and refuses this file
# when an entry has no reason or expires more than 31 days out. Remove the
# entry with the fix.
